<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="542611607"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:54.770"><div begin="13.187" end="39.175" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="13.187" end="15.416" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.187" end="13.995">朋友</span><span begin="13.995" end="14.350">已</span><span begin="14.350" end="15.416">走</span></p><p begin="15.544" end="21.791" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.544" end="15.923">刚</span><span begin="15.923" end="17.054">升职的</span><span begin="17.054" end="17.518">你</span> <span begin="17.518" end="17.879">举</span><span begin="18.037" end="18.763">杯</span><span begin="18.763" end="19.131">到</span><span begin="19.131" end="19.712">凌</span><span begin="19.712" end="20.439">晨还</span><span begin="20.439" end="20.871">未</span><span begin="20.871" end="21.791">够</span></p><p begin="22.018" end="25.312" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.018" end="22.845">用尽心</span><span begin="22.845" end="23.238">机</span><span begin="23.238" end="23.990">拉我</span><span begin="23.990" end="25.312">手</span></p><p begin="26.027" end="35.023" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.027" end="27.323">缠在我</span><span begin="27.323" end="28.521">颈</span><span begin="28.521" end="28.910">背</span><span begin="28.910" end="29.910">后</span> <span begin="30.073" end="33.364">说你男友有事忙是</span><span begin="33.364" end="33.890">藉</span><span begin="33.890" end="35.023">口</span></p><p begin="35.193" end="39.175" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.193" end="35.549">说</span><span begin="35.549" end="35.764">到</span><span begin="35.764" end="37.489">终于饮醉</span><span begin="37.489" end="39.175">酒</span></p></div><div begin="39.440" end="1:04.771" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="39.440" end="41.784" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.440" end="40.264">情侣</span><span begin="40.264" end="40.664">会</span><span begin="40.664" end="41.784">走</span></p><p begin="41.886" end="48.281" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.886" end="42.217">刚</span><span begin="42.217" end="43.473">失恋的</span><span begin="43.473" end="43.858">你</span> <span begin="43.967" end="44.347">哭</span><span begin="44.347" end="45.107">干</span><span begin="45.107" end="45.971">眼涙</span><span begin="46.133" end="46.745">前来</span><span begin="46.745" end="47.131">自</span><span begin="47.131" end="48.281">首</span></p><p begin="48.313" end="51.871" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.313" end="48.713">寂寞</span><span begin="48.713" end="49.129">因</span><span begin="49.129" end="49.500">此</span><span begin="49.500" end="50.348">牵我</span><span begin="50.348" end="51.871">手</span></p><p begin="52.446" end="59.381" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.446" end="53.598">除下了</span><span begin="53.598" end="54.016">他</span><span begin="54.016" end="54.806">手</span><span begin="54.806" end="55.198">信</span><span begin="55.198" end="56.094">后</span> <span begin="56.430" end="57.208">我已得</span><span begin="57.208" end="57.706">到</span><span begin="57.706" end="58.437">你没</span><span begin="58.437" end="59.381">有</span></p><p begin="59.699" end="1:04.771" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.699" end="1:00.878">但你我</span><span begin="1:00.878" end="1:02.086">至少往后</span><span begin="1:02.086" end="1:02.987">成为了</span><span begin="1:02.987" end="1:03.315">密</span><span begin="1:03.315" end="1:04.771">友</span></p></div><div begin="1:05.851" end="1:35.024" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:05.851" end="1:08.930" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.851" end="1:06.621">闭起双眼</span> <span begin="1:06.621" end="1:08.250">你最挂念</span><span begin="1:08.250" end="1:08.930">谁</span></p><p begin="1:09.084" end="1:12.293" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.084" end="1:09.538">眼睛</span><span begin="1:09.538" end="1:09.883">张开</span> <span begin="1:09.883" end="1:11.490">身边竟是</span><span begin="1:11.490" end="1:12.293">谁</span></p><p begin="1:12.453" end="1:18.850" itunes:ke