"2:00.018">刚</span><span begin="2:00.018" end="2:01.170">相恋的</span><span begin="2:01.170" end="2:01.551">你</span> <span begin="2:01.552" end="2:02.024">先</span><span begin="2:02.024" end="2:02.739">知</span><span begin="2:02.888" end="2:03.296">我</span><span begin="2:03.296" end="2:03.611">们</span><span begin="2:03.611" end="2:04.488">原来</span><span begin="2:04.488" end="2:04.864">未</span><span begin="2:04.864" end="2:05.867">够</span></p><p begin="2:06.078" end="2:09.342" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:06.078" end="2:06.451">借故</span><span begin="2:06.451" end="2:06.869">松</span><span begin="2:06.869" end="2:07.222">开</span><span begin="2:07.222" end="2:07.889">我</span><span begin="2:07.889" end="2:08.083">的</span><span begin="2:08.083" end="2:09.342">手</span></p><p begin="2:10.019" end="2:17.003" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:10.019" end="2:11.197">藏在贴</span><span begin="2:11.197" end="2:11.654">纸</span><span begin="2:11.654" end="2:12.438">相</span><span begin="2:12.438" end="2:12.833">背</span><span begin="2:12.833" end="2:13.841">后</span> <span begin="2:14.049" end="2:14.452">我这</span><span begin="2:14.452" end="2:15.206">苦心</span><span begin="2:15.206" end="2:15.818">开过</span><span begin="2:15.818" end="2:16.122">没</span><span begin="2:16.122" end="2:17.003">有</span></p><p begin="2:17.296" end="2:22.537" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:17.296" end="2:17.611">但</span><span begin="2:17.611" end="2:19.061">试过散心</span><span begin="2:19.061" end="2:19.289">旅</span><span begin="2:19.289" end="2:19.607">游</span> <span begin="2:19.607" end="2:20.457">如何答</span><span begin="2:20.457" end="2:20.839">没</span><span begin="2:20.839" end="2:22.537">有</span></p></div><div begin="2:23.344" end="2:58.703" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:23.344" end="2:26.360" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:23.344" end="2:24.101">闭起双眼</span> <span begin="2:24.101" end="2:25.606">我最挂念</span><span begin="2:25.606" end="2:26.360">谁</